<section class="guide-planning section section--page-width" aria-labelledby="GuidePlanning-{{ section.id }}">
  <header class="guide-planning__header">
    <p class="guide-planning__eyebrow">Plan your project</p>
    <h2 id="GuidePlanning-{{ section.id }}">What are you working on?</h2>
    <p>Start with the structure you need, then check the space, site, and local requirements before choosing a model.</p>
  </header>
  <nav class="guide-planning__topics" aria-label="Project topics">
    <a href="#guide-sheds">Sheds &amp; storage</a>
    <a href="#guide-shade">Gazebos &amp; pergolas</a>
    <a href="#guide-greenhouses">Greenhouses</a>
    <a href="#guide-kitchens">Outdoor kitchens</a>
    <a href="#guide-carports">Carports &amp; garages</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="guide-planning__grid">
    <article id="guide-sheds"><h3>Sheds &amp; outdoor storage</h3><p>Measure what you will store, the usable interior, door opening, and a clear path to move items in and out.</p></article>
    <article id="guide-shade"><h3>Gazebos &amp; pergolas</h3><p>Plan for furniture, walking space, sun, drainage, anchoring, and any electrical work.</p></article>
    <article id="guide-greenhouses"><h3>Greenhouses</h3><p>Start with growing goals, bench space, ventilation, access, water, and year round exposure.</p></article>
    <article id="guide-kitchens"><h3>Outdoor kitchens &amp; entertaining</h3><p>Separate cooking, preparation, and dining zones. Check clearances and local utility requirements.</p></article>
    <article id="guide-carports"><h3>Carports &amp; garages</h3><p>Check vehicle height, door clearance, turning space, drainage, foundation, and local permits.</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="guide-planning__checklist" id="guide-checklist">
    <div>
      <p class="guide-planning__eyebrow">Planning tool</p>
      <h2>Outdoor project checklist</h2>
      <p>Use this list while you plan. Print a copy to take measurements and note what you still need to verify.</p>
      <button type="button" class="guide-planning__print" onclick="window.print()">Print checklist</button>
    </div>
    <ol>
      <li>Measure the available footprint and the access route from delivery point to site.</li>
      <li>List the items, people, or vehicles the structure must accommodate, including future space.</li>
      <li>Check usable internal dimensions, openings, and room to move around.</li>
      <li>Assess slope, drainage, ground condition, and the required foundation and anchoring.</li>
      <li>Ask your local authority and HOA about permits, setbacks, and applicable rules.</li>
      <li>Confirm delivery access, utilities, assembly space, and product specific instructions.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .guide-planning { max-width: 128rem; margin-inline: auto; padding-block: clamp(4.8rem, 7vw, 9.6rem); color: #342d27; }
  .guide-planning__header { max-width: 72rem; }
  .guide-planning__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #756957; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .guide-planning h2, .guide-planning h3 { font-family: var(--font-heading--family); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.15; }
  .guide-planning h2 { margin: 0 0 1.6rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 4vw, 5rem); }
  .guide-planning h3 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 2.4vw, 3rem); }
  .guide-planning p, .guide-planning li { line-height: 1.65; }
  .guide-planning__topics { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-block: 3.2rem; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; }
  .guide-planning__topics a { flex: none; min-height: 4.4rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #c9c2b8; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .guide-planning__topics a:is(:hover, :focus-visible) { border-color: #342d27; text-decoration: underline; }
  .guide-planning__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 5rem); }
  .guide-planning__grid article { min-width: 0; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #c9c2b8; scroll-margin-top: 12rem; }
  .guide-planning__grid p { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0; }
  .guide-planning__checklist { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 8rem); margin-top: clamp(5rem, 8vw, 10rem); padding: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 5rem); background: #f6f3ed; }
  .guide-planning__checklist ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 2.4rem; }
  .guide-planning__checklist li + li { margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .guide-planning__print { min-height: 4.4rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 2rem; border: 0; background: #342d27; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
  @media (max-width: 749px) { .guide-planning__grid, .guide-planning__checklist { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .guide-planning { padding-inline: 2rem; } }
  @media print { #MainContent > .shopify-section:not(:has(.guide-planning)), .guide-planning__header, .guide-planning__topics, .guide-planning__grid, .guide-planning__print { display: none; } .guide-planning__checklist { display: block; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #fff; } }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Guide planning", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "Guide planning" }] }
{% endschema %}
